{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Estimated Playtime (Episode 1): ~2 hours</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the post-apocalyptic world of Bifrostia, where mutants and robots coexist among the ruins of a lost technological civilization. The story takes place in Ilgrot \u2014 a rust-covered city governed by an artificial intelligence, where strange events unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One seemingly ordinary day, you discover a mysterious space shuttle with an unusual robot on board. You will have to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- escape the city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- uncover the robot\u2019s secret and its origin,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- find out why it is being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with characters and the environment, solve puzzles, and complete mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual Style:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized hand-painted visuals convey a retrofuturistic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambient soundtrack with cyberpunk elements enhances the mood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dance King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/89428a44522dacfd7254062f4ac93895f23407ee.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/41fbf92e1a7fca499f6471880fa0c96cb4fba4a4.jpg"},{"name":"Full Set","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/b4004c97001537012b6b0563b3036dc76e11f22a.jpg"},{"name":"Generosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco